I see a strange vegetable.
The vegetable is a long root.
The root is very pale.
It looks like a white carrot.
I look down at the sign.
It says "parsnip" on the sign.
I do not know the vegetable.
Is it a Danish vegetable?
I like vegetables.
I like carrots.
Maybe the parsnip tastes good.
I take the parsnip in my hand.
The root is quite big.
I would like to have it.
I look at the basket.
I put the root in the basket.
I would like to try something new.
